====== TP-Link TL-WR850N v1 ======

The device is a wireless N router with 
  * 2 fixed antennas
  * 4 Port 100/10 Switch
  * 1 Port 100/10 Wan Interface
  * 8 MB Flash
  * 64 MB Ram
  * WPS Button

**''Note1:''** The [[.:tl-wr840n_v4|TL-WR840N v4]] as well as TL-WR850N v1,v2 & v3 are identical. But TL-WR850N v3 (4/32) can not be supported.

